      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……はて。\r\nわしの家は、その通路の先だったかの？",
        "official_en": "Which is why I can’t find my way back home. It’s most certainly <text style=\"italic\">not</> because of my age. Was it through this corridor? Hmm...",
        "real_en": "...Now, was my house down that passage?"
      },
