        "official_en_sha256": "f837bdb1316a9656d4df55bb5e5921e06b3675b7d8fe883faf29785784bcd7c7"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここの酒は飲んだか？\r\n口の中を消毒されてるみてえな味だが、\r\nよく酔えると評判さ！",
        "official_en": "You tried the booze here yet? It tastes like Firaga in your mouth, but it’ll get you hammered in no time!",
        "real_en": "Have you tried the liquor here? It tastes like someone's disinfecting your mouth, but they say it gets you drunk fast!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
