        "official_en_sha256": "0cdaf8f3d05389d55099261ef934bcf13e3ba5846a8f565abf0c5222306db95d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、今のディルナドはよ……\r\nわりぃ、国の奴らには言えねぇからつい、な。",
        "official_en": "But Dirnado now, though? I... Sorry, not sure why I’m telling you this, stranger. Guess I’ve a lot pent up since I can’t badmouth the country in front of other Dirnadian folks.",
        "real_en": "But Dirnado these days... Sorry. I can't say this to anyone from my own country, so I guess I let it slip."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
