      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ん？　それじゃただの飛空艇か？",
        "official_en": "A ship that flies! I’m a genius! I’ll call it: the “Air...ship.” Wait a minute...",
        "real_en": "Hm? Wouldn't that just make it an airship?"
